10. `SOURCE_VERIFICATION_REGISTER.md`

Every important decision should be traceable to evidence or clearly marked as a proposal requiring approval.

# PART 21 — IMMEDIATE EXECUTION ORDER

Execute the work in controlled stages.

### Stage 1 — Read-only archive and site audit

Review all relevant archives and current website files. Verify the current technical state, inventory URLs, inspect existing functionality and document the actual problems.

### Stage 2 — Controlled SEMrush research

Verify API costs and balance. Protect the initial research budget. Research the highest-value opportunities first and record the results.

### Stage 3 — University data verification

Establish the inclusion criteria for the complete directory. Start with Ternopil National Medical University and verify every material claim against official sources.

### Stage 4 — Architecture and page templates

Design the directory, university profile, course page, tuition guide and application journey. Each template must support unique, verified content.

### Stage 5 — Staging implementation

Repair the identified issues and implement the reusable directory and application system in staging. Use Unsplash images appropriately.

### Stage 6 — Service tiers

Define, price and test the three service tiers. Keep the personalised tier interface hidden until the student reaches the defined application stage.

### Stage 7 — Validation

Run the technical, factual, security, usability, conversion and SEO checks. Record actual test results.

### Stage 8 — Approval and ongoing growth

Present the evidence, staging result, remaining risks and proposed release plan. Do not deploy without approval.

# FINAL STANDARD

The objective is to build a highly useful, trustworthy and professionally operated destination for international students who want to study medicine and related healthcare subjects in Ukraine.

SEMrush drives SEO decisions. Official sources verify university facts. Ternopil National Medical University is our main initial university focus. The directory covers every relevant institution that meets the documented verification criteria. Fees must be accurate and dated. Unsplash imagery must be appropriate and properly sourced. The online application system must be secure. The three service tiers must be transparent and deliverable. WhatsApp is not a CTA. Paid advertising remains at £0.

Every page must justify its existence through genuine student value, a distinct search purpose, a measurable conversion path and a maintenance plan.

Build carefully. Verify everything. Protect the API budget. Test in staging. Record every material decision.

**The ultimate goal is a durable organic acquisition and medical admissions business that creates lasting value for the owner's daughter.**



